.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Submit an AI job:
.RS
aitbc ai submit --prompt "What is AI?" --model gpt-4
.RE
.PP
Check wallet balance:
.RS
aitbc wallet balance
.RE
.PP
Start mining and check status:
.RS
aitbc mining start --wallet-name my-wallet
.br
aitbc mining status
.RE
.PP
Monitor system:
.RS
aitbc monitor dashboard --refresh 5
.RE
.PP
List GPU offers on the market:
.RS
aitbc market offer-list --service-type gpu
.RE
.PP
Query chain sync status:
.RS
aitbc blockchain sync-status
.RE
.PP
Manage configuration:
.RS
aitbc config set --key api_key --value your_api_key_here
.br
aitbc config show
.RE
.PP
Cross-chain agent communication:
.RS
aitbc agent-comm register --agent-id agent1 --name agent1 --endpoint http://node2:9100 --chain-id ethereum
.br
aitbc agent-comm list --chain-id ethereum
.RE
.PP
Analytics and monitoring:
.RS
aitbc analytics summary --chain-id ethereum --hours 24
.br
aitbc analytics monitor --realtime
.RE
.PP
Multi-chain operations:
.RS
aitbc blockchain list
.br
aitbc blockchain info --chain-id bc-2
.RE
.PP
Output in different formats:
.RS
aitbc --output json wallet balance
.br
aitbc --output yaml market offer-list
.RE
.PP
Verbose output:
.RS
aitbc -vv blockchain block --height 12500000
.RE
.PP
Configuration profiles:
.RS
aitbc config profiles save --name production
.br
aitbc config profiles load --name production
.RE
